    "text": "\u00d0is is \u00fe\u00e6re healfan hide landgem\u00e6ro \u00e6t m\u00e6wi.\n\u00c6rest on cleaca \u00feonne adun on m\u00e6wi of \u00e6lbroc.\n\u00deonne on \u00e6lbroc of \u00feone \u00e6wylman.\n\u00deonne east on gerihte to \u00feam merc stane.\nOf \u00feam merc stane to \u00feam blacan pytte & \u00feanne on gerihte to odda wylle.\nAdun on odda wylles lace to \u00fean ford lace.\nUpp on stream to \u00feam \u00e6wylman, \u00feanon eastrihte to boc s\u00e6tena hig wege.\n\u00deonne ut on \u00feone hig weg to \u00feam cyric wege, \u00feanon on gerihte to \u00feam mere.\nOf \u00feam mere to edswy\u00fee torre.\nFram edswy\u00f0e torre on gerihte eft on cleaca.\n\u00deis is \u00fe\u00e6re healfan hide landboc to m\u00e6wi \u00fee cnut cing het gebocian \u00e6\u00feerice his \u00feegene on ece yrfe.",
